  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "──それでは、以上でお敬幼少期役の福丸さん\r\nクランクアップになりますー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "福丸さん、お疲れ様でしたー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "演者たち",
    "text": "お疲れ様でした～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0209",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2300
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040010,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お、お疲れ様です……！\r\nあ、ありがとうございました……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040220070",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "106",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "うんうん、ほんとおつかれ～\r\n福丸さんのお敬、良かったよ～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい……あ、ありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "……話題性を出すためにね、若い頃の役とかは\r\nアイドルを起用することが多いからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "今回はどうなるかなー……って思ってたけど\r\nや～福丸さんで良かったと思ったよ～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "色々と考えて演じてくれたってわかったからさ\r\n僕も嬉しかったよ、ほんと、ありがとね～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "い、いえ……そんな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
