  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──小糸にとっていい現場だったなら\r\n終わるのが寂しいなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい、でも…………\r\n色々なことを学ばせてもらって、嬉しかったです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "022",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、例えばどんなことを学んだんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "えっと、ですね……昔は、義理のお兄さんと結婚することも\r\n多かったって資料で学んでたんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "でも、お敬はそれが叶わず、別の人のところに嫁ぎます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "最初はそれが悲しくて、辛く見えるようにって\r\nお敬の役とか、演技を考えてました……でも……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040100"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00224",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "本当は兄の信重にずっと感謝の気持ちを持っていて──\r\n恋心のような、でも、違う心……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "見守ってくれていて……ありがとうって心を\r\n伝えたかったんだなって、教えられました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "教えられたって……信重役の俳優さんにか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい、きっかけはそうです……\r\nだ、だけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "恋じゃなくても大切って気持ちの人を想う……\r\nいつも見守ってくれている人を慕う感じ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "本当の、家族のような人を思う感覚────",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……それを考えさせてくれたのは……\r\n教えてくれたのは…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……ふふ、ひ、秘密、ですっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええ？　気になるなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、ほ、放送されたら、見て考えてみてください……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201104/2022011040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011040190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……本当にわかられたら恥ずかしいけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
